        "evidence": "Only one drawer fits (drawer:0#0,0#cut). After I placed it, the configurator offered no more drawer sockets. Asking for a 3-storey drawer gave no offers either. A quarter base gave no drawer offers at all. Notch and bay drawers need neighbouring bases, which the brief forbids."
